{"id":"aa1ce7fbd5a355c2","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-fixed-point-minimal-characterization.md","title":"最小固定点的三种刻画","display":"lem-fixed-point-minimal-characterization — 最小固定点的三种刻画","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-fixed-point-minimal-characterization","aliases":["91-lem-fixed-point-minimal-characterization","91-lem-minimal-fixed-point-char","91-lem-minimal-unique"],"display":"lem-fixed-point-minimal-characterization — 最小固定点的三种刻画","depends_on":["[[91-thm-iteration-convergence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-fixed-point-minimal-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-fixed-point-minimal-characterization</span><span>91-lem-minimal-fixed-point-char</span><span>91-lem-minimal-unique</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-fixed-point-minimal-characterization — 最小固定点的三种刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b78700f82584ead6\" href=\"?note=b78700f82584ead6\" title=\"91-thm-iteration-convergence\">91-thm-iteration-convergence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\)</span> 为单调算子。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall X,Y\\subseteq S\\,(X\\subseteq Y\\to J(X)\\subseteq J(Y))\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall X,Y\\subseteq S\\,(X\\subseteq Y\\to J(X)\\subseteq J(Y))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}(J)=\\{X\\subseteq S:J(X)=X\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}(J)=\\{X\\subseteq S:J(X)=X\\}\\)</span> (固定点集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(S))\">\\(\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(S))\\)</span>；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(S)\">\\(\\Gamma:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b78700f82584ead6\" href=\"?note=b78700f82584ead6\" title=\"91-thm-iteration-convergence\">91-thm-iteration-convergence</a> 的序列：\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha)\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha+1&lt;\\eta\">\\(\\alpha+1&lt;\\eta\\)</span>），\n非零极限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda&lt;\\eta\">\\(\\lambda&lt;\\eta\\)</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta\">\\(\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\min\\{\\alpha:\\alpha+1&lt;\\eta\\land\\Gamma_\\alpha=\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}\\}\">\\(\\kappa=\\min\\{\\alpha:\\alpha+1&lt;\\eta\\land\\Gamma_\\alpha=\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}\\}\\)</span>；\n上游收敛定理保证该集合非空。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)=\\bigcap\\{A\\subseteq S:J(A)\\subseteq A\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{lfp}(J)=\\bigcap\\{A\\subseteq S:J(A)\\subseteq A\\}\\)</span> 采用同一上游的定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in S\">\\(x\\in S\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}characterization}\n\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n=\n\\bigcap\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\n=\n\\Gamma_\\kappa\n=\n\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\kappa+1}\\Gamma_\\alpha\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}characterization}\n\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n=\n\\bigcap\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\n=\n\\Gamma_\\kappa\n=\n\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\kappa+1}\\Gamma_\\alpha\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等价地，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\,(x\\in X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\,(x\\in X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>迭代阶段由单调性归纳地包含于每个固定点；闭包阶段自身又是固定点，\n故它就是最小固定点。递增性给出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_\\kappa=\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\kappa+1}\\Gamma_\\alpha\">\\(\\Gamma_\\kappa=\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\kappa+1}\\Gamma_\\alpha\\)</span>；不能在未证明\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为极限序数时删去最后一阶段。固定点集包含这个最小元，所以其交恰好\n等于它。</p>\n<p>精确闭包序数取决于具体算子。只有对规范的有效强 Kleene 跳跃并给出\n相应可计算性分析时，才可进一步识别为特定可数序数；一般单调算子不能\n无条件写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1^{CK}\">\\(\\omega_1^{CK}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：一般单调幂集算子的上游收敛证明；原书 §8.7、§15.1 的真理算子是其特例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-iteration-convergence","status":"resolved","id":"b78700f82584ead6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-iteration-convergence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-iteration-convergence","status":"resolved","id":"b78700f82584ead6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(S))$；\n$\\Gamma:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(S)$ 为 [[91-thm-iteration-convergence]] 的序列：\n$\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing$、$\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha)$（$\\alpha+1<\\eta$），\n非零极限 $\\lambda<\\eta$ 处取 $\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta<\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall X,Y\\subseteq S\\,(X\\subseteq Y\\to J(X)\\subseteq J(Y))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}(J)=\\{X\\subseteq S:J(X)=X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(S))","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J(\\Gamma_\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha+1<\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda<\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta<\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa=\\min\\{\\alpha:\\alpha+1<\\eta\\land\\Gamma_\\alpha=\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)=\\bigcap\\{A\\subseteq S:J(A)\\subseteq A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}characterization}\n\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n=\n\\bigcap\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\n=\n\\Gamma_\\kappa\n=\n\\bigcup_{\\alpha<\\kappa+1}\\Gamma_\\alpha\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"x\\in\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\,(x\\in X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma_\\kappa=\\bigcup_{\\alpha<\\kappa+1}\\Gamma_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1^{CK}","display":false}],"bytes":2329,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-fixed-point-minimal-characterization]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-fixed-point-minimal-characterization]]"}],"outgoing":["b78700f82584ead6"]}